  "title": "GitLab CI: Coverity: Exclude lemon source",
  "description": "It's third party, and we don't ship it but only use it during the\nbuild process to generate files. We don't really care about warnings,\nespecially leaks.\n\nhttps://community.blackduck.com/s/article/Exclude-Unwanted-Files-from-Coverity-Scan-and-Manage-Unwanted-Issues-in-CIM\n\nNote that page (and others) claim that the style is regex, but show\nexamples using globbing.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
